00:14:40.217 --> 00:14:42.050
I'm really excited to
be here with you today

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:43.758
to talk about some of
the work that we've

00:14:43.758 --> 00:14:47.270
been doing to improve the
functionality of Google's

00:14:47.270 --> 00:14:49.280
global virtual networks.

00:14:49.280 --> 00:14:51.440
I'm going to walk you
through a use case, which

00:14:51.440 --> 00:14:54.530
is sort of a real life
