00:50:42.860 --> 00:50:44.690
INES ENVID: Yeah,
so when we actually

00:50:44.690 --> 00:50:48.670
talk about providing private
connectivity to managed

00:50:48.670 --> 00:50:53.350
services, Cloud SQL is not
