00:50:53.350 --> 00:50:55.320
just to be super clear.

00:50:55.320 --> 00:50:58.370
The reasons, there can be
a lot of details behind.

00:50:58.370 --> 00:51:03.590
But the way we connect to a
Cloud SQL, our managed SQL,

00:51:03.590 --> 00:51:07.190
it is different than the
path in which we connect

00:51:07.190 --> 00:51:09.350
through APIs to
these other services,

00:51:09.350 --> 00:51:11.570
so it requires additional work.

00:51:11.570 --> 00:51:14.260
So it is not
